                            Jan 15, 2025
                            </span>
                            <a href="#" target="_blank" class="absolute inset-0 md:translate-y-full transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-y-0 text-primary font-medium">
                            Read More
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="group cursor-pointer">
                        <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-medium leading-tight transition-all duration-200 text-black">
